  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/976396/description_e9c4a5bf-f2ac-4419-924c-2aa5d5f64fb7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"208\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/976396/description_3a54f5d1-36f4-4c64-8db4-55cbed985b5e.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"340\"></strong></em><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/976396/description_c85d98d6-af7d-4435-bbee-7d0cd2446e59.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"225\">&nbsp;</strong></em></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>&nbsp;</strong></em><em style=\"color:#999;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/976396/description_9a0ca09f-28cf-430b-ab00-b55c7bb9b1e5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"444\" height=\"222\"></strong></em><em><strong> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/976396/description_1628e2a5-4fb8-4e05-bb3f-41057fd8a867.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"338\" height=\"338\"></strong></em></h1>\n<p><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/976396/description_425a7c8c-adaf-4e20-8a56-1b1faee502e6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"142\"></strong></em></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Gabi_9b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/976396/description_99b89751-af99-4b25-8cc5-8f4f3531eb78.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Rj8c8gppeu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/976396/description_3fa6fc68-4581-4634-b486-2a57bd0b8376.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"></a><br></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/976396/description_c16ce89f-2104-49fa-8dee-2eca2a3041ef.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"142\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">這是一款植物大戰殭屍模組，讓<strong>你</strong>可以在 Minecraft 中體驗植物大戰殭屍的世界！</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/976396/description_02658894-632e-4a83-8671-bc77811e34ec.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"788\" height=\"493\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>希望你會喜歡這個模組 ;)</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>目前包含的植物列表：</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3>豌豆射手<br>向日葵<br>櫻桃炸弹</h3>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>目前包含的殭屍列表：</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3>普通殭屍<br>路障殭屍<br>雪人殭屍</h3>\n</div>\n<p><br><strong>問：我可以將此模組用於我的整合包嗎？</strong><br><strong>答：當然可以！你可以自由地在你的整合包中使用此模組！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>問：這個模組會繼續更新嗎？<br>答：會的！我們計劃添加大量內容，但由於我們才剛剛開始，所以也請預料可能會有一些錯誤！</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/976396/description_4b5b4133-5795-4f27-b2e3-9d5372362afc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"142\"></strong></p>",
